  "reviewedBoundaries": [
    "URI strictly decoded once via existing file URI parser and compared to original capture source path; checkRevision content mode compares all seven source fields.",
    "Confirmed known text validates current conversion vocabulary, UTF-8 byte budget, digest and partial-selection consent before dispatch; null source never becomes a resource link.",
    "Cold composer marks every retained attachment recovered; cold queued attachment objects are marked for explicit review; reparsing compares source/text/hash/size/partial/images/warnings while retaining old snapshot on failure.",
    "Official resource normalization ignores incoming localDocumentText; local authority is projected only from checked outgoing data; explicit official equality strips only local metadata for exact echo comparison.",
    "wirePromptBlocks enumerates official resource fields, excluding all local source/version/consent metadata.",
    "Queue editor relies on WeakMap object identity plus original content; duplicate content and cold restored editors cannot select a target by equality.",
    "createDocumentInputTarget captures draft object/generation, attachment identity, new choice, context/storage locks and pending state; cancellation or removal invalidates only its exact loading chip.",
    "Read/confirm callbacks require their original ticket, apply consumes once, and saved hint requires matching draft key/attachment id/exact approved object; delayed saves retain in-memory input/global error.",
    "Complete validated AST serializer traverses all body/table/nested/story blocks, includes explicit merge anchors and escaping; noteReference is separate from literal author text and omitted images/markers do not qualify as author text.",
    "Backend obtains one actual connection, derives both original session control and embedded capability from it, retains preview prohibition and old pump failure, never searches for a second connection after validation."
